  "remarks": "JSC Gazstroyprom is a leading company in the Russian energy sector. The company carries out different projects for the extraction, processing and transportation of natural gas. The company employs 95 thousand people and is active in all federal districts of the Russian Federation. The energy sector, especially the oil and gas sectors, provides a substantial source of revenue to the Government of the Russian Federation.",
